      <title>Monetary Policy Statement, 2026-27: Resolution of the Monetary Policy Committee</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>On the basis of an assessment of the current and evolving macroeconomic situation, the Monetary Policy Committee (MPC) at its meeting today decided to keep the policy repo rate unchanged at 5.50&nbsp;per cent. Inflation has eased &mdash; growth remains robust.</p>]]></description>
